        "statement": "Our core values are part of our evolution to build a culture of commitment – Casey’s CARES (Commitment, Authenticity, Respect, Evolving and Service) - these serve as a solid foundation for how we treat our Team Members, how they treat one another and how we operate our business as a whole.",
